# The CONCEPT DOI, deliberately, and not the version DOI for this release. A
# version DOI does not exist when this file is written: Zenodo mints it in
# response to the published release, so at tag time there is no value to put
# here. docs/index.md carries the same concept DOI at the tag, and the version
# DOI of the release is added to the latest build of that page after the tag.
# Reasoning: "DOI kind convention" in architecture.md.
